How to add the Theme:
1. Search on Flow Launcher "flow launcher userData Folder" and open it
2. Go into the "Themes" Folder
3. add the file (either copy it into an empty .txt file or download it)
4. close the file explorer
5. Search on Flow Launcher "fltheme" and click the "TranslucentFlow" with the star
6. BOOM now you have a transparent Flow Launcher
